WEBVTT

01:28.340 --> 01:34.940
Our Secret
EP08

01:36.390 --> 01:37.640
I see now.

01:38.150 --> 01:39.280
My daughter's grown up.

01:39.710 --> 01:41.790
You think you can make a choice by yourself, right?

01:42.110 --> 01:43.640
I can't control you anymore, right?

01:45.840 --> 01:47.670
But I can still control you! Am I right?

01:49.840 --> 01:50.840
I don't care!

01:52.150 --> 01:53.470
No matter what method you use,

01:53.670 --> 01:55.560
you have to change her to the liberal arts class!

01:56.430 --> 01:57.840
If you can't, let me tell you,

01:58.030 --> 01:58.670
from tomorrow,

01:58.840 --> 01:59.960
wash your clothes yourself!

02:00.110 --> 02:00.880
Cook by yourself!

02:01.030 --> 02:02.280
I won't care about you anymore!

02:03.280 --> 02:04.110
You…

02:15.280 --> 02:16.280
Xianxian

02:17.440 --> 02:19.230
Your teacher paid a home visit today.

02:19.669 --> 02:21.160
He gave us this.

02:23.720 --> 02:25.160
That's what your mother's angry for.

02:26.640 --> 02:27.870
Xianxian

02:28.280 --> 02:30.360
Do you know why your mother's so angry?

02:30.800 --> 02:32.510
She thinks you've grown up.

02:32.750 --> 02:34.030
and don't need her anymore.

02:34.230 --> 02:36.030
She doesn't know how to express it,

02:36.230 --> 02:37.590
so she behaves like that.

02:37.950 --> 02:39.470
You should understand her.

02:41.000 --> 02:42.750
I should also criticize you.

02:43.030 --> 02:44.390
Why did you keep it as a secret

02:44.640 --> 02:46.080
to hand in the application form?

02:48.440 --> 02:51.030
Dad. It's my bad.

02:52.160 --> 02:54.000
I should have told you.

02:55.360 --> 02:57.030
Please help me beg mom

02:57.310 --> 02:59.360
not to change me to the liberal arts class, okay?

02:59.800 --> 03:02.110
I feel really happy at my present class.

03:02.640 --> 03:06.310
And I don't want to be separated from my friends.

03:07.390 --> 03:09.870
Alright. As for your mom,

03:10.110 --> 03:11.640
I can help you.

03:12.310 --> 03:13.280
But,

03:13.750 --> 03:15.310
I am not that capable.

03:15.920 --> 03:17.640
I can only give you one month.

03:17.800 --> 03:18.840
For next monthly test,

03:19.000 --> 03:20.360
try to get a good grade.

03:21.080 --> 03:22.310
If you can do it,

03:22.950 --> 03:24.800
there will be a way out of this.

03:24.800 --> 03:25.510
Alright?

04:11.160 --> 04:13.950
So students to the liberal arts and natural science classes

04:14.160 --> 04:15.440
are temporarily settled.

04:16.160 --> 04:18.109
It's not finalized, of course.

04:18.510 --> 04:20.840
If some of you still want to study liberal arts

04:21.040 --> 04:23.070
after studying for a while in this class,

04:23.230 --> 04:24.630
tell me as soon as possible

04:24.790 --> 04:26.000
to change it.

04:27.230 --> 04:29.190
As for the placement test questions,

04:29.720 --> 04:30.720
I won't teach them.

04:31.000 --> 04:33.600
Later I'll hand out answers to you.

04:33.910 --> 04:36.160
Analyze your errors after class,

04:36.320 --> 04:38.510
and hand in the analysis before this Friday.

04:39.040 --> 04:40.999
Alright. Let's continue.

04:46.950 --> 04:48.600
I can only give you one month.

04:48.760 --> 04:49.790
For the next monthly test,

04:49.950 --> 04:51.390
try to get a good grade.

04:51.999 --> 04:53.320
If you can do it,

04:53.880 --> 04:55.720
there will be a way out of this.

04:55.720 --> 04:56.390
Alright?

05:04.950 --> 05:06.000
What's on your mind?

05:09.790 --> 05:10.760
I was thinking…

05:13.280 --> 05:14.600
I don't see great changes

05:14.790 --> 05:16.790
of this class placement.

05:17.280 --> 05:18.510
Because students who choose liberal arts

05:18.720 --> 05:19.840
are few in reality.

05:20.560 --> 05:22.000
No changes?

05:22.320 --> 05:23.790
My dream girl, Yang Chunzi, left.

05:26.160 --> 05:27.440
Now that you miss her so much,

05:29.040 --> 05:30.600
just go with her.

05:32.040 --> 05:33.350
It's too late.

05:35.560 --> 05:37.600
Do you know anything else also late?

05:37.760 --> 05:38.720
What?

05:40.350 --> 05:42.440
The game disc I lent to you before.

05:42.950 --> 05:43.880
I won't lend it now.

05:43.880 --> 05:44.480
No, no, no.

05:44.790 --> 05:46.110
Please! Lend me for a while!

05:46.480 --> 05:47.840
Ask Yang Chunzi if she has it or not.

05:47.950 --> 05:48.950
Borrow it from her.

05:50.560 --> 05:51.390
I won't give you.

05:51.390 --> 05:52.670
Song Ziqi! Kong Shadi!

05:53.280 --> 05:54.390
Stand up!

05:57.480 --> 05:58.560
It's all your fault.

06:01.630 --> 06:02.630
Stand back!

06:06.910 --> 06:09.040
Let's take out Mathematics Compulsory III.

06:10.190 --> 06:11.350
Turn to Page 23.

06:14.070 --> 06:15.480
Let's continue our class.

06:16.670 --> 06:19.190
Let's learn Euclidean algorithm.

06:20.350 --> 06:22.630
Euclidean algorithm is a kind of algorithm

06:22.840 --> 06:24.790
recorded by Euclid in the "Elements".

06:26.160 --> 06:27.760
Assume two integers are unequal.

06:27.950 --> 06:31.190
Divide the larger one by the smaller one.

06:31.440 --> 06:32.160
If the remainder

06:32.320 --> 06:34.440
is still a non-zero number,

06:34.630 --> 06:36.999
continue to divide until the remainder is zero.

06:44.440 --> 06:45.350
Dad

06:46.230 --> 06:46.950
Xianxian

06:47.110 --> 06:48.560
Why do you come to this floor?

06:48.720 --> 06:50.350
Didn't you say you would give me one month?

06:50.760 --> 06:51.790
I come here to print a material.

06:51.999 --> 06:54.280
The printer upstairs breaks down. Don't worry.

06:55.880 --> 06:57.230
Did you chat with my mom?

06:57.480 --> 06:58.790
Is she still angry?

06:59.840 --> 07:01.070
Still a little bit.

07:02.280 --> 07:04.320
She has another requirement for you.

07:04.630 --> 07:07.000
Get at least 270 points in natural science.

07:07.950 --> 07:09.720
That's killing me.

07:10.320 --> 07:11.910
Just give my life to her!

07:12.190 --> 07:15.000
My silly girl! Your life was originally given by your mom.

07:16.190 --> 07:18.000
Well, I am not that capable.

07:18.280 --> 07:19.670
That's all I can help you.

07:20.510 --> 07:21.600
Fighting!

07:23.230 --> 07:24.350
Thanks, Dad.

07:26.790 --> 07:28.950
How can I get 270 points?

07:35.600 --> 07:37.560
Studying while preparing for the competition

07:38.440 --> 07:39.950
is such a burden for normal people.

07:42.440 --> 07:43.320
Poor thing!

07:55.070 --> 07:56.070
You are awake.

07:57.480 --> 07:59.510
Did you stay up late to study?

08:01.880 --> 08:03.480
Aren't you too tired in this way?

08:04.040 --> 08:05.230
Can you get enough sleep?

08:07.350 --> 08:08.440
It doesn't matter.

08:09.000 --> 08:10.760
I've just made up for it.

08:20.350 --> 08:21.390
What happened to you?

08:25.280 --> 08:26.000
May I ask you:

08:26.510 --> 08:27.480
Is there a way

08:27.480 --> 08:29.070
to raise my grade to 270 points

08:29.110 --> 08:31.480
of natural science in one month?

08:37.990 --> 08:38.720
By dreaming.

08:44.240 --> 08:45.280
Right now,

08:45.430 --> 08:46.600
don't think too much.

08:46.750 --> 08:47.920
Do more exam papers.

08:48.630 --> 08:51.040
At your current level, you cannot even get 250 points,

08:51.430 --> 08:52.630
let alone 270 points.

08:54.680 --> 08:55.990
You're the 250 ("250" means "stupid" in Chinese)!

09:04.160 --> 09:06.430
At least, I should work hard from now on.

09:06.840 --> 09:07.750
Fighting!

09:27.310 --> 09:28.310
Come on, Congcong.

09:28.750 --> 09:29.800
Eat more meat.

09:30.160 --> 09:32.240
Your body are growing. Eat more.

09:35.990 --> 09:36.840
Mom

09:37.240 --> 09:39.840
Why did you make so many delicious dishes today?

09:40.190 --> 09:42.600
I wouldn't do it if you were not students.

09:43.990 --> 09:45.950
Come on. Dishes will be cold soon.

09:52.600 --> 09:53.550
Delicious!

10:00.600 --> 10:02.550
Mom. Thanks for your hard work.

10:02.750 --> 10:03.680
Eat more.

10:05.800 --> 10:07.480
I've been cooking for over a decade.

10:07.720 --> 10:09.430
Not until now have I heard a good word.

10:10.600 --> 10:11.720
Come on, Congcong.

10:12.360 --> 10:13.390
Eat more.

10:17.800 --> 10:19.510
What a big dinner this evening!

10:23.040 --> 10:23.720
Where's mine?

10:31.750 --> 10:33.310
Well, I, I'm not that hungry.

10:34.190 --> 10:35.840
Help yourselves, help yourselves.

10:36.800 --> 10:38.160
I'll go reading for a while.

11:01.040 --> 11:02.070
Tomorrow is weekend.

11:02.870 --> 11:05.600
I'll take you to fill a prescription for your lenses.

11:07.070 --> 11:07.950
Thanks, Mom.

11:08.950 --> 11:10.070
Don't slack off in your study.

11:10.550 --> 11:12.840
Two hundred and seventy points. We've made a deal.

11:12.990 --> 11:14.310
One point less is not allowed.

11:19.950 --> 11:21.070
Two hundred and seventy.

11:21.360 --> 11:22.840
One point less is not allowed.

11:27.920 --> 11:28.950
Be quiet.

11:29.390 --> 11:30.630
The last weekly physics test papers

11:30.800 --> 11:31.630
have been handed out.

11:31.870 --> 11:33.160
Mr. Yang asks every student

11:33.310 --> 11:35.160
to bring the error analysis

11:35.190 --> 11:36.310
to him in his office in one week.

11:36.480 --> 11:37.430
Don't forget it.

12:02.120 --> 12:02.950
What's going on?

12:03.600 --> 12:04.870
I'm helpless!

12:05.750 --> 12:06.750
Let me see.

12:16.920 --> 12:18.750
You got the formula wrong for this question.

12:19.160 --> 12:20.310
You should've got this score.

12:22.680 --> 12:23.510
And this one.

12:24.750 --> 12:26.240
You didn't understand this question well.

12:26.920 --> 12:29.390
The mass of the ping-pong ball is a misleading proposition.

12:29.800 --> 12:31.190
You should've also got this score.

12:35.750 --> 12:36.360
And this one.

12:37.160 --> 12:38.480
It's even more unreasonable.

12:38.800 --> 12:40.160
Every procedure is right

12:40.280 --> 12:42.360
except for the result, which is so easy to get.

12:42.950 --> 12:44.680
What were you thinking at that time?

12:45.950 --> 12:47.550
If I could do everything right,

12:47.990 --> 12:50.360
I would be the one to get 90 points.

12:51.280 --> 12:52.950
No excuse for doing it wrongly.

12:56.390 --> 12:57.280
This one…

13:14.160 --> 13:15.070
Xianxian

13:16.430 --> 13:17.390
Su

13:18.190 --> 13:19.360
Why are you here?

13:20.120 --> 13:22.390
Don't you need to take classes back in your university?

13:23.390 --> 13:24.480
The new term hasn't begun yet.

13:24.630 --> 13:25.990
So I want to come here to see you.

13:28.920 --> 13:30.310
Are you free now?

13:44.480 --> 13:45.990
Your mom is so demanding of you,

13:46.240 --> 13:48.430
because she believes you are able to do it.

13:49.720 --> 13:51.190
Don't be discouraged.

13:51.990 --> 13:53.070
Because I also believe

13:53.600 --> 13:54.680
you can do it.

13:58.160 --> 14:00.040
I also thought I could,

14:00.950 --> 14:03.040
but no comparison, no harm.

14:06.310 --> 14:08.040
If there's anything you don't understand, you can ask me.

14:09.800 --> 14:11.190
Didn't you learn liberal arts?

14:11.600 --> 14:12.750
You look down upon me, don't you?

14:12.950 --> 14:14.680
It's a piece of cake for me to teach you.

14:17.550 --> 14:19.160
Maybe I think

14:19.950 --> 14:22.070
I'm not that confident.

14:23.870 --> 14:25.120
Thanks anyway, Su.

14:26.190 --> 14:26.750
Oh, right.

14:27.510 --> 14:28.990
I have another thing to say.

14:31.390 --> 14:32.510
On the day of the graduation ceremony,

14:32.600 --> 14:33.920
I wanted to take a photo with you.

14:34.430 --> 14:35.480
But I didn't get a chance.

14:35.680 --> 14:36.950
You should make it up to me today.

14:37.800 --> 14:38.630
No problem.

14:39.630 --> 14:40.240
Come here.

14:57.750 --> 14:58.990
How time flies!

14:59.190 --> 15:00.600
You're a college student now.

15:01.240 --> 15:03.680
Does it mean we won't see each other for a long time?

15:04.920 --> 15:05.600
What are you afraid of?

15:05.750 --> 15:07.040
I'll come back during vacation.

15:11.240 --> 15:12.360
I should go back for the class.

15:12.840 --> 15:14.550
Our class supervisor will come there soon.

15:20.430 --> 15:21.160
Xianxian

15:37.190 --> 15:38.070
This is for you.

15:42.800 --> 15:43.920
I hope you

15:45.310 --> 15:46.840
can smile like that forever.

15:50.190 --> 15:50.950
Definitely.

15:53.840 --> 15:54.800
Go back for your class.

16:17.190 --> 16:18.430
Xianxian, it just occurred to me…

16:22.630 --> 16:24.360
Who took this photo for you?

16:24.630 --> 16:26.240
Su took it for me just now.

16:26.310 --> 16:27.120
Let me see. Let me see.

16:27.190 --> 16:28.550
Look at the smile while looking back.

16:29.600 --> 16:30.990
Su really knows how to take photos!

16:31.480 --> 16:32.630
Look, look, look.

16:34.680 --> 16:36.600
I've written down reasons why you made mistakes.

16:36.750 --> 16:38.120
Look at them carefully this evening.

16:39.190 --> 16:40.510
And there are two papers.

16:42.190 --> 16:43.800
Finish them and give me tomorrow.

16:46.920 --> 16:49.070
Two papers for one evening?

16:49.720 --> 16:51.480
If you find them hard, don't do them.

16:51.800 --> 16:53.950
If you get 200 points, you can still go to a college.

16:55.750 --> 16:57.070
I didn't mean it.

16:58.040 --> 16:58.950
Zhou Siyue

16:59.360 --> 17:01.510
Why are you so cruel to our Xianxian?

17:02.920 --> 17:04.240
Am I cruel to her?

17:04.750 --> 17:06.550
College entrance examination is much crueler than me.

17:06.790 --> 17:08.120
I'm helping her.

17:12.000 --> 17:12.840
How about that?

17:13.400 --> 17:15.720
Pay attention to the National Mathematics Olympiad first.

17:18.720 --> 17:21.520
Fine. I won't care about you anymore.

17:47.150 --> 17:48.190
Xianxian

17:49.790 --> 17:51.400
Why haven't you been to the school?

17:51.880 --> 17:54.190
Good morning. I'm waiting for Zhou Siyue.

17:54.360 --> 17:55.480
Did he go downstairs?

17:56.400 --> 17:57.670
Didn't he tell you?

17:58.030 --> 18:00.150
He went to the training camp with other team members

18:00.190 --> 18:02.070
of the Olympiad by bus this early morning.

18:06.150 --> 18:07.190
I see.

18:07.760 --> 18:09.120
I'll go to school now, Madam.

18:10.000 --> 18:11.150
Be careful.

18:11.880 --> 18:12.670
Good-bye, Madam.

18:12.670 --> 18:13.310
Good-bye.

18:16.840 --> 18:21.070
With huge waves are gone all those. Gallant heroes of bygone years.
(A Song Poem by Su Shi)

18:21.430 --> 18:22.840
West of the ancient fortress appears.

18:23.150 --> 18:26.950
At Red Cliff General Zhou won fame during the Three Kingdom.

18:27.240 --> 18:30.600
Rocks tower in the air and waves teat on the shore.

18:30.950 --> 18:33.000
Rolling up a thousand heaps of snow.

18:38.480 --> 18:40.480
Zhou Siyue is off for the National Olympiad.

18:42.310 --> 18:43.480
Not until now do I notice

18:44.070 --> 18:45.240
that it's so hard to get used to the days

18:45.240 --> 18:46.480
without a deskmate.

18:49.030 --> 18:50.600
It seems as if he went to

18:50.640 --> 18:52.150
a battlefield alone.

18:53.600 --> 18:55.520
It may just be my illusion.

18:57.150 --> 18:58.070
After all,

18:59.150 --> 19:00.310
he should be very familiar with

19:00.360 --> 19:02.150
this kind of competition life.

19:12.400 --> 19:14.550
Who would pluck them?
(A Song Poem by Li Qingzhao)

19:14.760 --> 19:18.240
Leaning on the window, how can I pass the time till night alone?

19:18.720 --> 19:20.600
The drizzle falls on the buttonwood trees.

19:20.880 --> 19:23.400
Rain-drops drip down at dusk.

19:23.910 --> 19:27.520
As a time like this, what immense sorrow I must bear!

19:30.030 --> 19:33.000
I always feel that he will go to a bigger

19:33.190 --> 19:34.670
and broader world.

19:36.150 --> 19:37.550
By his light,

19:38.360 --> 19:40.670
I've also glimpsed what the broad world looks like.

19:42.360 --> 19:43.640
I come to realize

19:44.550 --> 19:46.360
that I also want to go there.

19:47.550 --> 19:49.030
I don't want to be left behind.

20:09.910 --> 20:11.270
I've heard that there's no

20:11.400 --> 20:13.150
recruitment plan for the Shot Put Team.

20:14.520 --> 20:15.480
Fine, fine, fine.

20:26.550 --> 20:27.310
What are you doing here?

20:28.000 --> 20:29.950
What? You frightened me!

20:31.430 --> 20:32.430
Are you tailing after someone?

20:34.670 --> 20:35.950
No, I'm not.

20:37.150 --> 20:38.190
How stubborn you are!

20:40.950 --> 20:42.480
Song Ziqi

20:43.000 --> 20:44.480
I understand he didn't wait for me after class.

20:44.790 --> 20:46.430
How dare he walk with another girl!

20:46.600 --> 20:47.480
Piss me off!

20:49.600 --> 20:50.480
Are you jealous?

20:51.400 --> 20:52.600
I'm not.

20:53.910 --> 20:54.840
I'll go home.

21:06.790 --> 21:07.760
Well,

21:09.310 --> 21:11.030
do you have any good idea?

21:13.480 --> 21:15.030
I haven't come up with one,

21:16.400 --> 21:17.840
but I'm a little bit hungry.

21:20.670 --> 21:21.430
I see.

21:21.520 --> 21:23.120
I'll treat you. Let's go!

21:26.120 --> 21:27.000
Xianxian

21:28.310 --> 21:29.430
Shadi, Keke.

21:32.000 --> 21:32.760
Xianxian

21:33.520 --> 21:35.070
Why do you study so hard recently?

21:35.400 --> 21:36.600
Monthly test is coming.

21:36.760 --> 21:38.240
I should be fully prepared.

21:43.360 --> 21:45.400
When did you two hang out together?

21:48.240 --> 21:49.270
Hello. May I help you?

21:49.270 --> 21:50.240
Two lemonades.

21:50.670 --> 21:51.190
Okay.

21:57.910 --> 22:00.550
I thought you didn't care about Song Ziqi.

22:01.670 --> 22:04.190
If the dog you raised from childhood ran with someone else,

22:04.240 --> 22:05.270
wouldn't you feel anxious?

22:05.910 --> 22:07.000
If I'm angry,

22:07.400 --> 22:09.190
Song Ziqi also cannot live cozily!

22:10.790 --> 22:11.760
I have an idea.

22:12.270 --> 22:13.240
You can also find someone else to hang out.

22:13.270 --> 22:14.190
Make him jealous.

22:17.030 --> 22:18.360
You can organize a party.

22:18.670 --> 22:20.520
Invite all classmates in front of him

22:20.790 --> 22:21.790
except for him.

22:21.840 --> 22:22.910
Let's see what his reaction is.

22:23.360 --> 22:24.360
Good idea!

22:25.000 --> 22:26.520
My birthday happens to be coming.

22:26.790 --> 22:29.030
I'll organize a birthday party this weekend.

22:29.150 --> 22:30.190
You must come there at that time!

22:32.240 --> 22:33.240
When did you two

22:34.030 --> 22:36.150
become such good friends?

22:37.240 --> 22:39.360
You friends are also my friends.

22:39.760 --> 22:40.670
Are you coming or not?

22:41.150 --> 22:42.910
Of course. I'm sure I'll go there.

22:44.310 --> 22:45.120
Here are your drinks.

22:47.950 --> 22:48.640
-Thank you.  –Thank you.

22:48.640 --> 22:49.360
You're welcome.

22:53.190 --> 22:54.150
Why are you here?

22:54.150 --> 22:55.190
Why didn't you say hello to me?

22:59.150 --> 23:00.270
Let me sip yours. I'm dying of thirst!

23:00.430 --> 23:01.310
Buy it by yourself!

23:02.070 --> 23:02.880
I'll drink…

23:04.790 --> 23:05.840
Song Ziqi

23:08.000 --> 23:09.120
What's wrong by drinking yours?

23:09.120 --> 23:10.030
How stingy you are!

23:14.840 --> 23:15.670
Thank you.

23:17.400 --> 23:18.550
Come on. Let's go home.

23:18.720 --> 23:19.550
Go back yourself.

23:19.790 --> 23:21.070
I'll go with Keke today.

23:24.120 --> 23:24.840
Alright.

23:25.000 --> 23:26.640
I'll go alone. Bye-bye.

23:42.430 --> 23:43.360
Do you think

23:44.240 --> 23:46.310
it's an indirect kiss?

23:54.670 --> 23:55.600
Okay. I see.

23:55.790 --> 23:57.480
Wait for me in the billiard room.

23:57.950 --> 23:59.360
We should stop here. I'll hang up now.

24:04.310 --> 24:05.030
Hello, Siyue!

24:05.550 --> 24:06.720
Aren't you in the training camp?

24:06.880 --> 24:07.480
Yes.

24:07.790 --> 24:08.640
Do me a favor.

24:08.840 --> 24:09.760
Take care of the little monster.

24:22.240 --> 24:24.670
Guys! I'll hold a birthday party this weekend.

24:24.840 --> 24:26.150
Come together!

24:26.600 --> 24:28.240
Okay. Who will be there?

24:29.360 --> 24:31.360
Just me, Ding Xian,

24:32.270 --> 24:34.520
and a girl in Class Ten.

24:34.720 --> 24:35.670
Only three of us.

24:36.030 --> 24:37.670
Come over there. All of you!

24:38.360 --> 24:39.150
Okay!

24:39.310 --> 24:41.190
Good. They two will just play for these days.

24:41.360 --> 24:42.000
Will you come or not?

24:42.120 --> 24:43.950
Kong Shadi, what do you do in your birthday party?

24:44.880 --> 24:46.030
In my birthday party?

24:46.640 --> 24:49.720
We just sing, have dinner,

24:49.880 --> 24:50.880
and play billiard.

24:50.910 --> 24:52.520
Whatever you want to do.

24:52.760 --> 24:55.240
You have fun, and my father pays the bill!

24:57.190 --> 24:58.760
-Is it great?  -Really?

24:58.790 --> 24:59.520
Don't cheat us!

24:59.520 --> 25:00.480
For what?

25:01.240 --> 25:02.000
I can prove it.

25:02.310 --> 25:04.400
The party last year was even bigger than this year's.

25:04.950 --> 25:06.600
To be honest, it was really interesting.

25:06.950 --> 25:08.030
Count me in.

25:08.520 --> 25:09.550
Count you in.

25:09.880 --> 25:10.640
Who else?

25:10.670 --> 25:12.480
Remember to come to me after class!

25:12.550 --> 25:13.720
Come to me! Come to me!

25:13.720 --> 25:15.640
Come to me after class! Did you hear me?

25:17.520 --> 25:18.360
Your Highness

25:18.950 --> 25:21.070
Are you going to celebrate your great birthday?

25:22.270 --> 25:23.840
What a big scale!

25:24.520 --> 25:25.950
Don't you know there will be a monthly test

25:26.000 --> 25:27.720
after the National Day holiday?

25:28.400 --> 25:29.910
Can you all get full marks

25:29.910 --> 25:30.950
or achieve something like that?

25:31.190 --> 25:31.880
Can you?

25:33.190 --> 25:33.880
No.

25:34.190 --> 25:35.480
Then cancel it!

25:36.430 --> 25:37.640
Do your homework!

25:45.150 --> 25:46.070
You two are awake?

26:08.670 --> 26:09.480
I'm coming!

26:10.840 --> 26:11.720
Xianxian

26:11.910 --> 26:13.120
Shadi, Keke.

26:13.310 --> 26:14.120
Come in.

26:17.520 --> 26:18.600
No need to change your shoes.

26:18.910 --> 26:20.120
I was just mopping the floor.

26:20.790 --> 26:21.720
Come in.

26:23.720 --> 26:24.720
Have a seat.

26:26.720 --> 26:27.950
Are you alone at home?

26:28.720 --> 26:31.120
My mom went out with my little brother.

26:31.520 --> 26:33.270
My father went back to Keshan.

26:34.760 --> 26:36.030
Why did you come here?

26:36.400 --> 26:37.910
To invite you to my birthday party!

26:39.670 --> 26:41.070
After being criticized by Auntie,

26:41.240 --> 26:42.790
didn't you say you wouldn't organize it?

26:43.670 --> 26:44.640
Forget it.

26:44.880 --> 26:45.950
Song Ziqi, the bastard,

26:46.120 --> 26:47.360
has no reaction at all!

26:47.760 --> 26:49.950
But it doesn't hinder us three

26:49.950 --> 26:51.030
to hang out together!

26:53.880 --> 26:54.720
But

26:54.790 --> 26:57.070
I still have so much homework to do.

26:57.640 --> 26:58.640
Are you nuts?

26:58.910 --> 27:01.310
Today's my birthday, Ding Xian.

27:01.910 --> 27:03.600
Yes. How about that?

27:03.600 --> 27:05.030
Take your homework with us.

27:08.480 --> 27:09.400
Okay.

27:10.000 --> 27:12.000
So, let's go!

27:12.520 --> 27:15.310
Ding Xian. Are you going to wear these

27:16.310 --> 27:17.720
to celebrate birthday with us?

27:18.000 --> 27:19.910
What's wrong with these clothes?

27:23.000 --> 27:23.950
I knew it.

27:24.520 --> 27:25.670
Thankfully, I prepared this.

27:26.030 --> 27:27.310
Here you are. Wear it.

27:28.120 --> 27:29.640
What's this?

27:31.310 --> 27:32.550
You celebrate your birthday.

27:33.600 --> 27:34.910
Why should I wear it?

27:34.910 --> 27:36.790
If I wear it, nobody's going to notice.

27:37.150 --> 27:38.190
Try it on.

27:41.190 --> 27:42.070
Hang on.

27:44.120 --> 27:45.190
What's the matter again?

27:45.720 --> 27:47.600
What's wrong with your jarhead?

27:48.640 --> 27:49.720
Don't mention it!

27:50.550 --> 27:52.070
Of course it's her who is to blame!

27:55.600 --> 27:57.000
Alright. Let me handle it for you.

27:57.030 --> 27:57.880
Let's go!

27:58.430 --> 27:59.120
How will you fix it?

27:59.480 --> 28:01.310
I'll help you to trim your jarhead.

28:02.150 --> 28:03.600
Will it become…

28:17.790 --> 28:19.600
If you keep doing it, I'll go back!

28:21.840 --> 28:22.640
It's the most boring birthday

28:22.670 --> 28:24.950
I've ever celebrated!

28:25.640 --> 28:28.120
How miserable I am!

28:30.310 --> 28:32.360
Well… How about shopping?

28:33.190 --> 28:34.120
Boring.

28:34.270 --> 28:35.240
How about the amusement park?

28:36.070 --> 28:37.430
Boring.

28:39.480 --> 28:40.480
Then what on earth do you want?

28:40.480 --> 28:41.600
I want a buzz.

28:41.840 --> 28:43.070
I want a party.

28:43.430 --> 28:46.640
I want him to hang out with me!

28:53.600 --> 28:55.030
I know you are all here.

28:58.150 --> 28:59.070
Aren't you celebrating your birthday?

28:59.430 --> 29:00.030
Where are others?

29:00.600 --> 29:02.120
The birthday party has been canceled.

29:04.360 --> 29:05.430
Didn't you say you wouldn't come?

29:06.360 --> 29:07.310
Why didn't I come?

29:07.760 --> 29:09.520
I went to each of your birthday party!

29:11.480 --> 29:12.270
This is your present.

29:13.520 --> 29:14.720
Don't ask me for more this year.

29:21.600 --> 29:23.070
What's the matter? Your Highness?

29:24.190 --> 29:25.640
She just wants a buzz,

29:25.790 --> 29:26.720
a party,

29:26.880 --> 29:28.640
and others to hang out with her.

29:29.880 --> 29:31.190
It's not a big deal.

29:31.550 --> 29:32.880
Come on. Let's go to karaoke together.

29:33.240 --> 29:35.120
I'll contact my classmates for you.

29:35.480 --> 29:36.190
Ask more to come here.

29:36.760 --> 29:37.400
Really?

29:38.120 --> 29:38.640
Okay.

29:39.600 --> 29:41.120
Xianxian, let's go together.

29:42.190 --> 29:43.120
You go and have fun.

29:43.840 --> 29:45.600
I should finish doing the paper first.

29:46.550 --> 29:47.880
Today's my birthday!

29:48.190 --> 29:49.640
I want you to be with me!

29:51.240 --> 29:53.190
I'm not really good at singing, actually.

29:53.520 --> 29:55.190
I'm afraid I'll spoil your spirits.

29:55.640 --> 29:56.950
After the monthly test,

29:56.950 --> 29:58.000
I guarantee that I'll make it up to you.

29:58.360 --> 29:59.120
I swear.

30:00.520 --> 30:01.720
Just let her go home.

30:01.880 --> 30:02.950
Or her parents will be worried.

30:04.600 --> 30:05.480
Alright.

30:06.070 --> 30:07.880
Be careful when you go back home.

30:08.310 --> 30:09.030
We'll go now.

30:09.030 --> 30:09.550
Okay.

30:09.790 --> 30:10.400
Bye-bye.

30:11.070 --> 30:11.720
Bye-bye.

30:19.520 --> 30:20.720
Zhou Siyue

30:21.880 --> 30:23.480
The monthly test is coming.

30:25.240 --> 30:27.520
If I can't get good grades this time,

30:28.030 --> 30:30.600
my parents will transfer me to a liberal arts class.

30:32.520 --> 30:33.950
I feel so nervous!

30:45.600 --> 30:46.550
Give me two.

30:46.550 --> 30:47.190
Okay.

30:53.190 --> 30:54.270
Here you are. Hold them.

30:54.310 --> 30:54.950
Thank you.

30:55.480 --> 30:56.030
Let's go.

30:57.550 --> 30:58.880
Excuse me. I need a bottle of water.

30:59.270 --> 30:59.840
Okay.

31:01.950 --> 31:02.360
Here's your change.

31:02.400 --> 31:02.880
Hold it.

31:03.070 --> 31:03.760
Okay. Thank you.

31:05.150 --> 31:06.360
Hello. May I help you?

31:06.480 --> 31:07.120
A bottle of water, please.

31:07.120 --> 31:07.600
Okay.

31:19.430 --> 31:20.400
Your phone's here!

31:20.400 --> 31:22.240
You! Thief! Stop!

31:35.120 --> 31:36.480
Hello. What's the matter?

31:36.670 --> 31:37.270
Siyue

31:38.400 --> 31:39.400
Ding Xian is being followed by someone.

31:39.880 --> 31:40.640
Where is she?

31:41.550 --> 31:42.030
I'll go there first.

31:42.030 --> 31:42.600
Stop!

31:42.600 --> 31:43.120
Go to find her.

31:43.150 --> 31:44.790
Thief! Give me my phone!

31:46.000 --> 31:47.030
What if I don't give it to you?

31:48.310 --> 31:49.240
Bro, you're here.

31:52.000 --> 31:52.760
It's you.

31:57.430 --> 31:58.030
Stop!

31:58.640 --> 31:59.190
Come back!

32:00.190 --> 32:00.880
Come down right now!

32:01.910 --> 32:02.520
Don't run!

32:02.880 --> 32:03.480
Come back!

32:04.720 --> 32:05.270
Stop!

32:05.360 --> 32:06.120
Come back!

32:13.360 --> 32:14.310
Song Ziqi. Come back now.

32:14.360 --> 32:15.120
Something's wrong.

32:24.190 --> 32:25.120
Open the door! Open the door!

32:25.190 --> 32:25.760
Get out!

32:26.550 --> 32:27.760
Open the door! Get out!

32:28.000 --> 32:29.240
Open the door! Hurry up!

32:29.400 --> 32:30.120
Open the door!

32:30.790 --> 32:32.190
Open the door! Get out right now!

32:33.150 --> 32:34.070
Get out right now!

32:34.840 --> 32:36.070
Do you think you're safe in there?

32:36.070 --> 32:36.670
Open the door!

32:36.720 --> 32:37.950
Hurry up! Get out!

32:38.070 --> 32:40.030
Open the door! Open it!

32:41.670 --> 32:42.480
Open the door!

32:49.070 --> 32:49.840
What are you doing here?

32:52.520 --> 32:53.790
Are you the one we met last time?

32:54.790 --> 32:55.640
Let me tell you.

32:56.240 --> 32:58.190
It has nothing to do with you.

32:58.240 --> 32:58.910
Leave us alone!

33:01.270 --> 33:02.310
What if I don't leave?

33:16.240 --> 33:16.910
What are you doing?

33:17.360 --> 33:18.240
Want a fight?

33:24.310 --> 33:25.120
Fuck you!

33:26.120 --> 33:27.000
Fight with us?

33:27.360 --> 33:27.950
Bastard!

33:30.760 --> 33:31.790
Look how weak you are!

33:35.480 --> 33:36.310
You piece of shit!

33:39.400 --> 33:40.070
Siyue

33:45.950 --> 33:46.720
Are you okay?

33:54.480 --> 33:55.270
Come on!

34:10.440 --> 34:11.200
Siyue

34:19.880 --> 34:20.510
What's going on?

34:20.550 --> 34:21.229
Who are you?

34:22.400 --> 34:23.400
If you don't want to die, piss off!

34:24.550 --> 34:25.120
Go.

34:25.840 --> 34:26.600
Go. Hurry up!

34:27.920 --> 34:28.640
Ding Xian

34:43.440 --> 34:44.120
Xianxian

34:44.640 --> 34:45.550
Are you okay?

34:45.640 --> 34:46.710
I feel so worried!

34:50.550 --> 34:51.749
I'll accompany her home now.

34:53.309 --> 34:54.120
Let's leave here right away.

34:54.229 --> 34:54.840
Or they'll ask more to come here.

34:54.840 --> 34:55.510
Let's go.

34:58.230 --> 34:59.270
Go, go, go!

35:00.070 --> 35:02.200
Well, I haven't celebrated my birthday.

35:03.120 --> 35:03.990
Let's go to celebrate your birthday.

35:04.030 --> 35:05.230
Let's sing! Go, go, go!

35:28.510 --> 35:29.310
Alright.

35:30.400 --> 35:31.400
Go upstairs now.

35:33.120 --> 35:34.880
Are you hurt?

35:35.120 --> 35:36.160
No.

35:36.790 --> 35:37.920
How come?

35:39.400 --> 35:40.310
Don't worry.

35:41.030 --> 35:42.160
From now on,

35:42.440 --> 35:43.840
they dare not make trouble on you anymore.

35:44.640 --> 35:46.750
How did you find me?

35:47.230 --> 35:48.200
Jiang Chen

35:48.400 --> 35:50.120
stumbled upon someone following you.

35:50.310 --> 35:51.680
So he called me.

35:56.920 --> 35:59.310
Did you see the message I texted to you?

36:00.640 --> 36:01.510
Yes, I saw it.

36:02.920 --> 36:03.920
You

36:05.030 --> 36:06.230
just relax.

36:06.550 --> 36:08.200
Don't give too much pressure on yourself.

36:09.960 --> 36:12.750
I got a good grade of mathematics last week.

36:13.510 --> 36:16.710
So I think I'll reach my goal in the monthly test.

36:17.880 --> 36:19.200
It seems that you can still

36:19.510 --> 36:21.070
get good grades without me around.

36:21.510 --> 36:22.470
Of course.

36:25.470 --> 36:26.360
No.

36:27.990 --> 36:29.200
If you're around,

36:30.160 --> 36:31.360
I can do better.

36:35.230 --> 36:36.160
Alright.

36:37.750 --> 36:38.840
Go upstairs.

36:40.310 --> 36:41.160
Okay.

36:49.200 --> 36:51.990
Zhou Siyue. You are sure to get good results.

36:54.750 --> 36:56.680
And I will also stay in the natural science class.

36:58.120 --> 36:58.990
Fighting!

37:00.510 --> 37:01.440
Fighting!

37:04.790 --> 37:05.640
I'm leaving.

37:49.840 --> 37:52.160
Mom! You scared me!

37:52.790 --> 37:54.120
Oh, you know you should come back.

37:54.750 --> 37:55.680
I…

37:57.400 --> 37:58.920
Whose clothes are you wearing?

38:01.230 --> 38:02.550
A classmate of mine.

38:02.960 --> 38:04.440
Today's her birthday.

38:04.920 --> 38:06.880
So we hung out together.

38:07.270 --> 38:08.160
Good for you.

38:08.680 --> 38:10.070
Your monthly test is coming.

38:10.360 --> 38:11.510
If you don't get good grades…

38:11.680 --> 38:12.440
I see!

38:13.470 --> 38:14.840
Mom. I will study hard.

38:43.270 --> 38:44.120
Hello.

38:46.840 --> 38:48.160
Did you come back?

38:50.640 --> 38:51.680
I'm in my dormitory.

38:54.120 --> 38:56.790
When you came back, were you criticized?

38:59.360 --> 39:00.400
How come?

39:01.440 --> 39:02.840
Teachers didn't notice it.

39:06.230 --> 39:07.070
That's great.

39:08.680 --> 39:09.640
I felt at ease when

39:09.710 --> 39:11.440
I heard your voice.

39:19.710 --> 39:21.270
Didn't you say you would study hard?

39:34.030 --> 39:35.310
If you leave the camp without permission,

39:35.310 --> 39:36.990
you will be disqualified!

39:36.990 --> 39:38.200
Do you know it or not?

39:38.680 --> 39:39.310
Where did you go?

39:39.310 --> 39:40.310
Are you going to tell me or not?

39:41.160 --> 39:41.880
If you aren't,

39:42.200 --> 39:43.640
run ten laps around the playground right now!

39:43.640 --> 39:44.510
Reflect on what you've done!
